  "details": "# Issue:\nIf have Portal Prompts enabled the  Tooltip will also say it's enabled, after restarting though, the Tooltip will revert back to the default disabled text, even though Portal Prompts are still enabled.\nSmall side note, after I updated my game the Portal Prompt button showed as disabled, even though it was still enabled, I needed to press the button twice so it worked correct again. (Seems like something is wrong with this button in general)",
